# PartyKit host for real-time multiplayer, e.g. "freetire.yourname.partykit.dev"
# (no protocol, no trailing slash — PartySocket adds wss:// itself).
#
# 1. npx partykit deploy         -> prints your *.partykit.dev host
# 2. Set this var locally (.env.local) and in your Vercel project settings.
# Leave unset to run solo-only (the lobby disables the multiplayer option).
NEXT_PUBLIC_PARTYKIT_HOST=
